    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThe best of both worlds - on a private site but a stroll from Tallow town centre!Situated on the highly sought after Youghal Road, within walking distance of the town centre, this 3 bed detached bungalow has huge potential in the right hands.In need of total renovation. The property has a private entrance driveway and is concealed to an extent by mature hedges and entrance gates with private driveway.Inside, the property has 2 reception rooms (lounge and living) with a kitchen/dining room extension to the rear that is in poor repair. Off the hallway there are 3 bedrooms and an office.Externally, the property has a detached block built garage to the side that opens to the driveway There are enclosed lawned gardens to the front and rear.With some work, this property would make the perfect home and locations don't come much better, located a stroll from all local amenities.(Government Vacancy Grants should apply subject to individual application.)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Government Vacancy Grants should apply subject to individual application.</li><li>Prime location on a popular road.</li><li>A stroll to town centre.</li><li>2 reception rooms - living room & lounge.</li><li>Mature private lawned gardens to front and rear. </li><li>Detached block built garage.</li><li>East facing rear garden.</li><li>Private driveway with lockable gates.</li><li>Mains water & sewerage.</ul>"
